# Tier 2 B2: GTEx v8 x UKB-derived LDL fixture (SORT1)
#
# We commit:
#   - fetch.sh, prepare.py, README.md, .gitignore
#   - fixtures/aligned.parquet         (harmonized, ~few MB)
#   - fixtures/gtex_liver_sort1.tsv.gz (locus slice, ~KB)
#   - fixtures/ukb_ldl_sort1.tsv.gz    (locus slice, ~KB-MB)
#   - fixtures/manifest.sha256         (SHA256 of every committed fixture)
#
# We ignore:
#   - .cache/ (raw multi-GB downloads - re-fetchable via fetch.sh)
#   - run-time scratch (logs, partial archives)

.cache/
.env_marker
*.log
*.tmp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
